Dear Aakash Verma,

Maria Solanki has asked us to register your firm as a supplier to Ashvaka Cem=
ent and Building Materials Limited for manpower supply. Please reply to this =
email with the following documents:

1. GST registration certificate (Form GST REG-06) for the state you will supp=
ly from
2. PAN of the vendor entity
3. Cancelled cheque with the account holder's name printed, or a bank letter =
signed and stamped by the bank
4. LLP certificate of incorporation (Form 16)
5. Contract labour licence
6. EPF registration certificate
7. ESIC registration certificate
8. Insurance certificate (employees' compensation or contractor's cover)

If you are registered as an MSME, please include your Udyam registration cert=
ificate. Copies must be clear and complete.

